name issue_12_lossbwe_congestive_seed7
describe issue_12_lossbwe_congestive with seed 7, traced on both stacks (yardstick for #402; not for merging)
seed 7
duration 40s
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=30ms queue=60ms
at 15s capacity=800kbps
expect net.loss_pct < 12
expect video.freeze_total_ms < 4000
expect cc.queue_p95_ms < 60
expect audio.interruptions <= 3
